 \subsubsection{Empirical Findings: Refusal Control on Negative Probes (Track 2)}
 On Track 2 (Table~\ref{tab:clerc_eval}, Panel B), Full TERRA establishes robust epistemic boundary discipline on external out-of-corpus queries:
